  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting food and nutrition security in Sudan through soybean processing</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to establish local processing facilities for soy milk and soy meal/cake as a means of addressing the Country#s food insecurity and nutrition situation. In addition, processing soybean within Sudan has the potential to increase overall revenue from soybean and open up new markets both locally and on the international market.</narrative>
